to questions.','Which of the following are reasons Sarah gives in support of school uniforms?','They allow students to express their personality','They reduce bullying and distractions','They make learning more fun and creative','They encourage students to wear fashionable clothes','B','Sarah argues that uniforms reduce bullying and distractions by promoting equality and minimizing competition over clothing. Options A and D are arguments against uniforms, and C is not mentioned in her argument.',NULL,0,1),
