('JHS','LS3',2,1,3,NULL,'Which of the following is TRUE about subsets?','A subset must contain at least one element.','Every set is a subset of itself.','A subset can never be equal to the original set.','The empty set is not a subset of any set.','B','',NULL,0,1),
('JHS','LS3',2,1,4,NULL,'If Set A is a subset of Set B, all elements of A are also in B. If B = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6} and A = {2, 4, 6}, which of the following statements is true?','A is a proper subset of B.','A is not a subset of B.','B is a subset of A.','A and B are disjoint sets.','A','',NULL,0,1),
