('JHS','LS3',2,1,25,NULL,'Factor the expression x² − 9.','(x + 3)²','x(x − 9)','(x − 3)(x + 3)','(x² − 3x)','C','x² − 9 is a difference of two squares: (x − 3)(x + 3).',NULL,0,1),
