('JHS','LS3',2,2,29,NULL,'Points E(2,3) and F(8,7) are plotted on the coordinate plane. Which of the following statements is true about the distance between E and F, and the midpoint of segment EF?','The distance is √40 units, and the midpoint is (5,5)','The distance is 10 units, and the midpoint is (5,5)','The distance is √52 units, and the midpoint is (5,5)','The distance is √52 units, and the midpoint is (6,4)','C','',NULL,0,1),
