('JHS','LS3',2,3,69,NULL,'Teacher Luisa recorded the scores of 9 learners on a quiz: Name Score Jake 56 Mark 62 Berna 68 Theresa 70 Joram 72 Junrey 75 Princess 78 Bebie Jean 80 Lhean 85 Teacher Luisa wants to know the correct definition of each measure of position. Which of the following statements would you tell her?','quartile divides a data set into ten equal parts.','A percentile indicates the value below which 25% of the data fall.','A decile divides a data set into four equal parts.','The interquartile range (IQR) is the difference between the highest and lowest values in the data set.','B','(Correct definition of the 25th percentile or Q1.)',NULL,0,1),
('JHS','LS3',2,3,70,NULL,'A manager of pater store recorded the number of sales made by 5 employees in a: Week 12, 15, 13, 10, 20 The manager wants to know each measure of variability. Which of the statement is INCORRECT information for the manager?','The variance is how much the data values deviate from the mode','The Interquartile Range is the range of the middle 50% of the data','The range is the difference between the highest and lowest values','Standard deviation is how much the data values typically differ from the mean','A','(Incorrect: variance relates to the mean, not mode.)',NULL,0,1),
